# Blasted Lands - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Blasted Lands accept in the local census (21 quests,
# docs/blasted-lands-census.md) appears exactly once as an accept; 21
# turnins close every record that has one in the data. The 8 repeatables
# (the Lost Supplies + the even Drazial/Lynnore/Kum'isha follow-ups), the
# Lunar Festival elder, and the min60 Warlock Dreadsteed chain are out with
# reasons in the census; no Horde quest accepts here (0 set aside, verified
# both ways). No race header and no class gates: nothing contracted is
# race- or class-locked. Zone-finale records above the band by level ride
# their minLevel anchor (2521/3501 min45, 2783/4128 min50); the three
# null-minLevel records (87295/91882/93685) are contracted on structural
# grounds argued in the census. Ungateable outside pres (2990 Hillsbrad,
# 96797 Alterac, 81900 Searing Gorge, 93684 Swamp) ride dedicated
# `when onquest` mini-steps or structural warnings with the chain named -
# none invented. Expedition turn-ins (Hinterlands, Swamp of Sorrows, Dun
# Morogh, Alterac, Mount Hyjal) switch frames deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/blasted-lands
title Blasted Lands - Completionist
levels 40-50
zone Blasted Lands
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Nethergarde Keep - arrival and the keep hub

  zone map 1419

  accept 96798 -- Into the Darkness - Lieutenant Connar; the orphan chain opens (needs 96797 The Orphan, Alterac, done - structural, chain named)
  accept 2783 -- Petty Squabbles - Ambassador Ardalan; a delivery for the Fallen Hero, south in the Swamp
  accept 4128 -- Ragnar Thunderbrew - Enohar Thunderbrew; a delivery for Ragnar, north in Dun Morogh
  accept 2991 -- Nekrum's Medallion - Thadius Grimshade; the medallion hunt (needs 2990 Thadius Grimshade, Hillsbrad, done - soft-pre mini-step below)
  accept 91882 -- The Grand Alliance - Ambassador Ardalan; a breadcrumb for Sefira Everbright in Mount Hyjal (endgame leg below)
  tip Nethergarde Keep is the hub: flight point, inn and vendors in the data live here; the orphan chain (96798/96811/96799/96812) resolves inside the keep except its Alterac finale.

step Nethergarde Keep - the Grimshade chain opens

  zone map 1419

  when onquest 2990

  complete 2991 -- Nekrum's Medallion (Nekrum Gutchewer carries it at 100%, but the data holds no spawn point for him anywhere; this complete carries no place - honest note, Badlands bag-note handling)
  turnin 2991 -- Nekrum's Medallion - the medallion back to Thadius Grimshade
  accept 2992 -- The Divination - Thadius Grimshade; the vision needs Grimshade himself struck down
  complete 2992 @66.90,19.47 -- Thadius Grimshade, at his point in the keep
  turnin 2992 -- The Divination - the word back to Thadius Grimshade
  accept 2993 -- Return to the Hinterlands - Thadius Grimshade; the word rides north to the Hinterlands
  tip Holding 2991 without 2990 (Thadius Grimshade, Hillsbrad - contracted nowhere) leaves this step dark until the pre is done.

step Drazial and Lynnore - the reagent chain opens

  zone map 1419

  accept 2581 -- Snickerfang Jowls - Bloodmage Drazial; jowls, lungs and a pincer
  accept 2583 -- A Boar's Vitality - Bloodmage Drazial; lungs, pincers and a brain
  accept 2585 -- The Decisive Striker - Bloodmage Drazial; pincers, gizzards and a lung
  accept 2601 -- The Basilisk's Bite - Bloodmage Lynnore; brains and gizzards
  accept 2603 -- Vulture's Vigor - Bloodmage Lynnore; gizzards and jowls
  tip All five one-times accept freely (their repeatable even-numbered follow-ups are OUT of contract); hunt the circuit below, then turn everything in here.

