  complete 2585 @44.40,32.40 -- Blasted Boar Lung (Helboar, center)
  complete 2581 @43.40,26.40 -- Scorpok Pincer (Scorpok Stinger, west flats)
  complete 2583 @47.58,35.67 -- Scorpok Pincer (Clack the Reaver, center)

