step Kum'isha - the draenethyst chain

  zone map 1419

  accept 2521 -- To Serve Kum'isha - Kum'isha the Collector; a flawless sphere (needs nothing before it)
  accept 3501 -- Everything Counts In Large Amounts - Kum'isha the Collector; an imperfect fragment
  accept 93685 -- To Serve Kum'isha - Kum'isha the Collector; the check-in (needs 93684 The Found One, Swamp of Sorrows, done - structural, chain named; same title as 2521, different chain, both routed)
  complete 2521 @41.14,12.45 -- Flawless Draenethyst Sphere (Dreadmaul Ogre, north-west camp)
  complete 3501 @41.21,11.71 -- Imperfect Draenethyst Fragment (Dreadmaul Brute, north-west camp)
  turnin 2521 -- To Serve Kum'isha - the sphere to Kum'isha the Collector
  turnin 3501 -- Everything Counts In Large Amounts - the fragment to Kum'isha the Collector
  turnin 93685 -- To Serve Kum'isha - the word back to Kum'isha the Collector

step Lynnore's Forever pair - chains and the lasso

  zone map 1419

  accept 81917 -- Chains That Bind - Bloodmage Lynnore; chain links off the Shadowsworn (needs 81900 The Burning Beast, Searing Gorge, done - soft-pre mini-step below)
  note 81919 Brought to Heel starts from item 220216 Infernal Lasso, which has NO source anywhere in the data (no drops, no vendors) - check bags and the auction house; this line never wedges on the drop.
  accept 81919 -- Brought to Heel - Bloodmage Lynnore; fel lifeblood off Calefactus
  complete 81919 @43.74,34.38 -- Fel Lifeblood (Calefactus the Unleashed, sole dropper, center)
  turnin 81919 -- Brought to Heel - the lifeblood to Bloodmage Lynnore

step Shadowsworn camps - infernal chain links

  zone map 1419

  when onquest 81900

  complete 81917 @61.81,42.11 -- Infernal Chain Link (Shadowsworn Cultist, east camp)
  complete 81917 @38.50,30.64 -- Infernal Chain Link (Shadowsworn Enforcer, west camp)
  turnin 81917 -- Chains That Bind - the links to Bloodmage Lynnore
  tip Holding 81917 without 81900 (The Burning Beast, Searing Gorge - contracted nowhere) leaves this step dark until the pre is done.

step Bernie Heisten - basilisk scales

  zone map 1419

  accept 87295 -- Deflective Surface - Bernie Heisten; ten Redstone scales (lvl52, just over the band top - contracted on structural grounds, census argued)
  complete 87295 @55.02,29.05 -- Redstone Basilisk Scale (Redstone Basilisk, east)
  complete 87295 @45.31,54.95 -- Redstone Basilisk Scale (Redstone Crystalhide, south)
  turnin 87295 -- Deflective Surface - the scales back to Bernie Heisten

step Nethergarde Keep - the orphan chain resolves

  zone map 1419

  turnin 96798 -- Into the Darkness - the word to Sergeant Danneth
  accept 96811 -- Escaping the Shadows - Sergeant Danneth; the shadows close in (needs 96798)
  turnin 96811 -- Escaping the Shadows - the word to Lieutenant Connar
  accept 96799 -- A Heavy Responsibility - Lieutenant Connar; the weight passes on (needs 96811)
  turnin 96799 -- A Heavy Responsibility - the word to Sergeant Danneth
  accept 96812 -- Thicker Than Water - Sergeant Danneth; the finale rides to Alterac (needs 96799)
  tip The whole chain resolves inside the keep except its Alterac finale below; holding 96798 needs 96797 The Orphan (Alterac - contracted nowhere) done first.

