  zone map 2482

  turnin 91882 -- The Grand Alliance - the breadcrumb to Sefira Everbright
  tip Endgame expedition leg to Mount Hyjal, far above band - Sefira's follow-ups (min54-57) live here; bank this turn-in for later rather than riding there at 40-50.
